# ---------- Agent skills & local tool config ----------
# Installed by `npx skills add <url>`, which vendors the fetched skills into the
# repo. Kept out of git: they are re-fetchable from their source, they carry no
# project decisions, and 29 files of third-party prose in the tree makes every
# diff harder to read than the skills are worth here.
#
# Commit them instead if collaborators ever need byte-identical versions — that
# is what skills-lock.json pins. Ignoring the lock file too, since pinning is
# only useful alongside the files it pins.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
.claude/settings.local.json
skills-lock.json

# ---------- Misc ----------
coverage/
.cache/
